1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,200
We started Nordlys in a basement
in Aarhus twelve years ago.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,000
There were three of us
and one sewing machine.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,100
It was enough.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,200
- What was the biggest mistake?
- Thinking we had to grow fast.

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,500
<i>We turned down every other order
that first year.</i>

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,400
Today we still make everything
by hand, here in Denmark.

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,000
Every single chair
takes fourteen days.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,200
That isn't something you rush.

9
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,500
Our customers are happy to wait,
because they know why.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,600
- Is it a luxury item?
- No. It's furniture that lasts.

11
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:38,000
My daughter will inherit this chair.

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,800
That's the whole idea behind Nordlys.
